{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience the world of MAGLA in this demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The MAGLA Demo lets you explore a slice of the game\u2019s magic-focused action and progression systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Play through the <strong>intro area</strong> and challenge the <strong>first boss</strong>.<br>\u2022 Unlock and use a full set of <strong>Ice-element skills</strong>, including the <strong>ultimate ability</strong>.<br>\u2022 Other magic systems (Fire and Earth) are still under development and not fully available in this demo.<br>\u2022 You can also <strong>mix elements to create hybrid spells</strong>, even in this demo version.<br>\u2022 Try out the working <strong>upgrade</strong> and\u00a0<strong>shop systems</strong> to customize your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo represents an early look at MAGLA\u2019s gameplay and systems. Try it out and get a feel for the magical chaos to come!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703270?t=1746723615","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703270?t=1746723615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703270/b65fa1847c12df6cd0b246d92cef51a205916516/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746723615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703270/b65fa1847c12df6cd0b246d92cef51a205916516/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746723615","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience the world of MAGLA in this demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The MAGLA Demo lets you explore a slice of the game\u2019s magic-focused action and progression systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Play through the <strong>intro area</strong> and challenge the <strong>first boss</strong>.<br>\u2022 Unlock and use a full set of <strong>Ice-element skills</strong>, including the <strong>ultimate ability</strong>.<br>\u2022 Other magic systems (Fire and Earth) are still under development and not fully available in this demo.<br>\u2022 You can also <strong>mix elements to create hybrid spells</strong>, even in this demo version.<br>\u2022 Try out the working <strong>upgrade</strong> and\u00a0<strong>shop systems</strong> to customize your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo represents an early look at MAGLA\u2019s gameplay and systems. Try it out and get a feel for the magical chaos to come!</p>","developers":["Mighty Bear"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3607510","name":"MAGLA"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703270/4b5e42d176a6d3a47fb6e06ed500fa13865a5d30/header.jpg?t=1746723615","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131267,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131267/movie480.mp4?t=1746723613","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131267/movie_max.mp4?t=1746723613"},"name":"MAGLA Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131267/0b35791d19c58aa8a9ad7a99ecf655225860b5ff/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746723613","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131267/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746723613","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131267/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746723613"}}],"name":"MAGLA Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (32/64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 2200G/Intel Core i3-2100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graph